Package: taxbroker
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: David Ogorevc <tax.brokerage.report@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/TheCodeFighter/TaxBrokerReport
Recommends: xdg-utils
Description: Turns broker exports into Slovenian FURS tax forms
 TaxBrokerReport reads Trade Republic and Interactive Brokers exports and writes the
 Slovenian tax forms Doh-KDVP, Doh-Div, Doh-DHO and Doh-Obr as XML for eDavki. It runs on
 your computer only: a local server opens the program in your browser, and nothing is sent
 anywhere.
 .
 Not tax advice and not affiliated with FURS or any broker; you check every value and file
 the return yourself. Provided as is, without warranty; no liability for tax errors, fines
 or omissions.
